{"title":"Career Roadmap · Port Operations Executive","role":"Port Operations Executive","summary":"A Port Operations Executive coordinates the movement of vessels, cargo, equipment, documentation and stakeholders within a port or terminal environment.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (General / Honours)","Course":"Merchant Navy – Maritime Science"},"about":[{"label":"Career Area","text":"Ports & Terminals / Shipping / Maritime Logistics / Supply Chain"},{"label":"Entry Potential","text":"Strong, particularly for port, terminal, shipping-agency, cargo and maritime-logistics operations"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a student with B.Sc Maritime Science, this is a strong shore-based maritime career option. The degree provides exposure to maritime operations, navigation, shipping practices, safety and vessel-related operations, while additional knowledge of port management, logistics, cargo operations and digital terminal systems makes the graduate more employable."},{"type":"note","label":"Important distinction","text":"A Port Operations Executive is a shore-based role. It is different from a Merchant Navy deck/engine officer, where specific maritime competency certificates, sea service and regulatory requirements apply."}]},{"heading":"What Does a Port Operations Executive Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between vessels, terminal operations, cargo, logistics companies, shipping agents, customs-related stakeholders and port authorities."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coordinating vessel arrival and departure"},{"text":"Monitoring berth allocation"},{"text":"Coordinating loading and unloading operations"},{"text":"Tracking cargo movement"},{"text":"Coordinating with shipping lines and agents"},{"text":"Supporting vessel turnaround"},{"text":"Preparing operational documentation"},{"text":"Coordinating with terminal operators"},{"text":"Monitoring container/cargo handling"},{"text":"Coordinating cranes and handling equipment"},{"text":"Tracking truck/rail cargo movement"},{"text":"Supporting customs and documentation processes"},{"text":"Monitoring delays and operational disruptions"},{"text":"Maintaining operational records"},{"text":"Preparing daily/weekly reports"},{"text":"Supporting safety and compliance"},{"text":"Coordinating with stevedores and contractors"},{"text":"Monitoring KPIs such as vessel turnaround time and cargo productivity"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Position","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Maritime student"},{"text":"Maritime fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Port/Shipping Intern"},{"text":"Operational exposure"}],[{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Operations Intern/Trainee"},{"text":"Port & cargo operations"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Operations Executive / Operations Trainee"},{"text":"Daily operations"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Senior Operations Executive"},{"text":"Vessel/cargo coordination"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Assistant Operations Manager"},{"text":"Team & shift management"}],[{"text":"7–12 years"},{"text":"Port Operations Manager"},{"text":"Terminal operations"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Senior Manager / Head of Operations"},{"text":"Strategic port operations"}]]}]},{"heading":"Core Knowledge to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Maritime Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"During the B.Sc, become strong in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maritime terminology"},{"text":"Ship types"},{"text":"Vessel structure"},{"text":"Navigation fundamentals"},{"text":"Maritime safety"},{"text":"Marine communication"},{"text":"Shipping operations"},{"text":"Port infrastructure"},{"text":"Maritime regulations"},{"text":"Cargo handling"},{"text":"Marine pollution prevention"},{"text":"Emergency procedures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding the ship-to-port interface is especially valuable."}]},{"heading":"Learn Port & Terminal Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Maritime Science student should deliberately add port-management knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Port infrastructure"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Berths"},{"text":"Jetties"},{"text":"Docks"},{"text":"Breakwaters"},{"text":"Container terminals"},{"text":"Bulk terminals"},{"text":"Liquid cargo terminals"},{"text":"Warehouses"},{"text":"Container yards"},{"text":"CFS/ICD concepts"},{"text":"Gate complexes"},{"text":"Rail terminals"},{"text":"Truck yards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Vessel operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vessel arrival"},{"text":"ETA/ETD"},{"text":"Berthing"},{"text":"Pilotage concepts"},{"text":"Mooring"},{"text":"Cargo operations"},{"text":"Unberthing"},{"text":"Vessel turnaround"},{"text":"Port stay"},{"text":"Demurrage concepts"},{"text":"Port dues"}]}]},{"heading":"Cargo Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand different cargo categories:"},{"type":"h","text":"Container cargo"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TEU/FEU"},{"text":"Container types"},{"text":"Container yard"},{"text":"Container handling"},{"text":"Reefer containers"},{"text":"Empty container management"},{"text":"Gate operations"},{"text":"Container tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dry bulk"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coal"},{"text":"Iron ore"},{"text":"Grain"},{"text":"Cement"},{"text":"Fertiliser"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bulk handling"},{"text":"Conveyors"},{"text":"Hoppers"},{"text":"Grab operations"},{"text":"Stockyards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Liquid bulk"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Petroleum"},{"text":"Chemicals"},{"text":"LNG/LPG"},{"text":"Edible oils"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tank farms"},{"text":"Pipelines"},{"text":"Transfer operations"},{"text":"Safety controls"}]}]},{"heading":"Port Operations Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern ports are becoming highly digital."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basics of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terminal Operating Systems (TOS)"},{"text":"Port Community Systems"},{"text":"Vessel Tracking Systems"},{"text":"RFID"},{"text":"GPS"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"Automated gates"},{"text":"OCR/container recognition"},{"text":"Digital documentation"},{"text":"Electronic Bills of Lading"},{"text":"Cargo tracking systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Common terminal-management concepts include systems such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Navis"},{"text":"Tideworks"},{"text":"terminal ERP/TOS platforms"},{"text":"Port Community Systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact software used depends on the port or terminal."}]},{"heading":"Data & Analytics Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is an important advantage for a modern maritime graduate."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Become strong in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vessel arrivals"},{"text":"Vessel turnaround"},{"text":"Cargo volumes"},{"text":"Container throughput"},{"text":"Berth utilisation"},{"text":"Crane productivity"},{"text":"Truck turnaround time"},{"text":"Port congestion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"Aggregation"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Window functions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python — optional but valuable"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"basic data analysis"},{"text":"forecasting"},{"text":"optimisation"}]}]},{"heading":"Key Port KPIs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Port Operations Executive should understand operational KPIs."},{"type":"h","text":"Vessel turnaround time"},{"type":"flow","items":["Arrival","Berthing","Cargo operations","Completion","Departure"]},{"type":"p","text":"Reducing unnecessary time improves terminal productivity."},{"type":"h","text":"Other KPIs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Berth occupancy"},{"text":"Crane productivity"},{"text":"Gross crane rate"},{"text":"Net crane rate"},{"text":"Container dwell time"},{"text":"Truck turnaround time"},{"text":"Yard utilisation"},{"text":"Vessel waiting time"},{"text":"Cargo throughput"},{"text":"Equipment utilisation"},{"text":"Gate processing time"},{"text":"Labour productivity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn not only what these KPIs mean, but how operational decisions affect them."}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Development","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maritime fundamentals"},{"text":"Shipping terminology"},{"text":"Ship types"},{"text":"Port terminology"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Professional documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Port Infrastructure Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a major port and document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Berths"},{"text":"Cargo terminals"},{"text":"Container yard"},{"text":"Rail connectivity"},{"text":"Road connectivity"},{"text":"Warehouses"},{"text":"Vessel types"},{"text":"Major cargo categories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Port operations"},{"text":"Cargo handling"},{"text":"Shipping documentation"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Supply