dmission, degree-equivalence, visa and professional requirements."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience, choose a specialisation."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Terminal Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yard"},{"text":"Gates"},{"text":"Cranes"},{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Vessel turnaround"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Vessel Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vessel scheduling"},{"text":"Berthing"},{"text":"Port calls"},{"text":"Shipping agents"},{"text":"Marine coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Cargo Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bulk cargo"},{"text":"Container cargo"},{"text":"Liquid cargo"},{"text":"Cargo handling systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Port Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Capacity planning"},{"text":"Berth planning"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Traffic forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Maritime Logistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Transition toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Port Operations","Logistics","Supply Chain Management"]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Port Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Maritime","Data Science","Operations Research"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This is an increasingly valuable pathway."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A realistic progression is:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc Maritime Science"},{"type":"h","text":"Port/Shipping Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Trainee / Operations Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Port Operations Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Port Operations Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Assistant Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Port Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Port Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Port/Terminal Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Port Operations Director / Terminal Director"}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The degree can also lead toward:"},{"type":"h","text":"Shipping"},{"type":"h","text":"Shipping Operations Executive → Shipping Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Logistics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Logistics Executive","Logistics Manager","Supply Chain Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Terminal Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Terminal Operations Executive → Terminal Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Maritime Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operations Analyst","Maritime Data Analyst","Maritime Analytics Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Port Planning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Planning Assistant","Port Planning Analyst","Port Planning Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Marine Services"},{"type":"h","text":"Marine Operations Executive → Marine Operations Manager"}]},{"heading":"Government & Public-Sector Opportunities","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Maritime Science graduate can explore opportunities associated with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major ports"},{"text":"Port authorities"},{"text":"Maritime boards"},{"text":"Port-led development organisations"},{"text":"Shipping organisations"},{"text":"Maritime research institutions"},{"text":"Government logistics programmes"},{"text":"Coastal and maritime infrastructure organisations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, eligibility varies by recruitment notification. Do not assume that a B.Sc Maritime Science automatically qualifies for every technical or officer-level government maritime post."},{"type":"p","text":"Check the specific:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Degree requirement"},{"text":"Subject requirement"},{"text":"Experience requirement"},{"text":"Age limit"},{"text":"Medical requirements"},{"text":"Competency certificate requirements"},{"text":"Recruitment examination"}]}]},{"heading":"Research & Advanced Study","kind":"other","blocks":