uter vision"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Maritime + Sustainability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Green ports"},{"text":"Port electrification"},{"text":"Alternative fuels"},{"text":"Carbon accounting"},{"text":"Emissions monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Maritime + Automation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated cranes"},{"text":"Autonomous vehicles"},{"text":"Smart gates"},{"text":"Robotic cargo handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Maritime + Cybersecurity"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Port OT security"},{"text":"Terminal systems security"},{"text":"Maritime cyber-risk management"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Maritime"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maritime Science"},{"text":"Shipping Operations"},{"text":"Port Operations"},{"text":"Cargo Handling"},{"text":"Vessel Operations"},{"text":"Maritime Safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Port Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Berth Planning"},{"text":"Terminal Operations"},{"text":"Yard Operations"},{"text":"Gate Operations"},{"text":"Port KPIs"},{"text":"Vessel Turnaround"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Logistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain"},{"text":"Freight"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Customs/Documentation Concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"TOS concepts"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"GIS — optional"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Lean"},{"text":"Six Sigma"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Leadership"}]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how a vessel moves through a port, coordinate cargo and terminal activities, interpret shipping and operational documentation, monitor port KPIs, identify operational bottlenecks, prepare reports and dashboards, and coordinate effectively with shipping, terminal, logistics and port stakeholders."},{"type":"p","text":"That is a strong profile for an entry-level maritime operations career."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc Maritime Science"},{"type":"flow","items":["Port/Shipping Internship","Learn Port & Terminal Operations","Shipping Documentation + Cargo Handling","Advanced Excel + Power BI + SQL","Port Operations Project","Operations Trainee / Port Operations Executive","Senior Operations Executive","Assistant Operations Manager","Port Operations Manager","Head of Port/Terminal Operations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best long-term specialisation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Maritime Science","Port Operations","Logistics","Data Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination gives the graduate opportunities across ports, container terminals, shipping companies, maritime logistics, cargo operations, terminal management and smart-port technology, rather than limiting the career to conventional port administration."}]}]}